  "description": "APPLICATION FOR A&nbsp;LAWFUL DEVELOPMENT CERTIFICATE INRESPECT OF THE PROPOSED ERECTION OF A&nbsp;HIP TO GABLE AND REAR DORMER ROOF&nbsp;EXTENSION AND X2 FRONT ROOFLIGHTS",
